<title>UK: FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of UK</p>
<p>company results expected in week ending April 18 include -</p>
<p>COMPANY----------------PFT/DIV/EPS--CONSENSUS----RANGE-------PVS</p>
<p>MONDAY, April 14</p>
<p>Associated British    I    PFT     200.2     187.0-209.0  198.0</p>
<p>Foods Plc	    DIV	4.25	4.25 4.3	4.3</p>
<p>TUESDAY, April 15</p>
<p>Lucas Varity	    Y    PFT    281.2	 276.1-290     N/A</p>
<p>		   *    DIV	7.0	  2.1-7.0	7.0</p>
<p>				   EPS     13.1	 13.0-13.2     N/A</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's The Estimate Directory - PFT</p>
<p>consensus 283.5 Div 7.00 EPS 12.8)</p>
<p>WEDNESDAY, April 16</p>
<p>Bodycote Intl	   Y   PFT     26.2	 24.5-26.7     18.9</p>
<p>			 DIV	8.0	  7.5-8.0	 6.5</p>
<p>				  EPS     28.5	 27.7-29.3     21.7</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's The Estimate Directory - PFT</p>
<p>consensus 27.0 Div 8.00 EPS 28.2)</p>
<p>THURSDAY, April 17</p>
<p>Fisher (Albert)	 I   PFT     18.8	 18.0-19.5     18.8</p>
<p>			 DIV	1.85	   1.85	 1.85</p>
<p>House of Fraser	 F   PFT     14.3	 14.0-15.0     14.3</p>
<p>			 DIV	5.5	    5.5	   5.5</p>
<p>				  EPS	4.8	  4.6-5.0	 5.0</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's The Estimate Directory - PFT consensus 14.0 Div 5.50 EPS 4.7)</p>
<p>* Analysts awaiting clarification of dividend policy. Dividend may be cut to accomodate buy back or be maintained.</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax, exclude exceptional items unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends are total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
